!Sample_data_processing = Cells were demultiplexed based on their HTO counts into their experimental conditions after normalization (centered log ratio transformation, margin = 2) using the HTOdemux or MULTISeqDemux function in Seurat.
!Sample_data_processing = gRNA identitied were assigned using MULTISeqDemux unless otherwise specified in the methods section of the manuscript.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Processed data provided in standard CellRanger output format for cDNA, GDO, and HTO. Each sample has 3 tab separated files separate into features, barcodes and a sparse matrix file.
